      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        369.2921142578125,
        313.4205627441406,
        381.2921142578125
      ],
      "text": "Reproduced from reference 4 by kind permission of the publisher. a",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        385.7801208496094,
        147.05538940429688,
        402.50811767578125
      ],
      "text": "Adherence",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        406.35430908203125,
        513.3799438476562,
        419.705810546875
      ],
      "text": "Adherence is critical for both anti-TB treatment and ART. Some drugs in both regimens",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        422.3507995605469,
        513.3683471679688,
        435.7023010253906
      ],
      "text": "have a profoundly unpleasant taste and many of the drugs can cause nausea and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        438.3472900390625,
        513.4144897460938,
        451.69879150390625
      ],
      "text": "vomiting. The number of drugs taken orally is a further complicating factor. If home",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        454.3437805175781,
        513.4719848632812,
        467.6952819824219
      ],
      "text": "treatment is not possible, injectables should be given daily at the local health clinic. In the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        470.34027099609375,
        513.3916015625,
        483.6917724609375
      ],
      "text": "treatment of DR-TB, directly observed therapy is essential; in some cases, hospitalization",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        486.3367614746094,
        513.4605102539062,
        499.6882629394531
      ],
      "text": "until completion of injectables is necessary. Vomiting caused by the thioamides and PAS",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        502.333251953125,
        513.4835815429688,
        515.6847534179688
      ],
      "text": "can often be overcome by initially splitting the daily dose or starting with a lower dose",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        518.3297729492188,
        513.3684692382812,
        531.6812744140625
      ],
      "text": "and increasing to full dose in 1-2 weeks, but single daily doses should be reinstituted",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        534.2572631835938,
        209.66488647460938,
        547.677734375
      ],
      "text": "(4) when vomiting stops .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        558.8327026367188,
        513.3914794921875,
        572.1842041015625
      ],
      "text": "Children should be monitored for three reasons: to determine response to therapy; to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        574.76025390625,
        513.4719848632812,
        588.1807250976562
      ],
      "text": "(5) identify adverse events early; and to promote adherence. Seddon et al   have suggested",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        590.8257446289062,
        472.5205078125,
        604.17724609375
      ],
      "text": "a monitoring schedule which can be adapted to local conditions and resources.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        626.22119140625,
        94.37739562988281,
        643.0772094726562
      ],
      "text": "R",
